{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44604","headline":"诗三百三首 三百一 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 三百一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒山无漏岩，其岩甚济要。\n八风吹不动，万古人传妙。\n寂寂好安居，空空离讥诮。\n孤月夜长明，圆日常来照。\n虎丘兼虎谿，不用相呼召。\n世间有王傅，莫把同周邵。\n我自遯寒岩，快活长歌笑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44604.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44604","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}